    "type": "game",
    "name": "Journey To The Center Of The Lost Waterpark",
    "steam_appid": 3792740,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a life guard. Or maybe not.<br>You are the waterpark's janitor outside opening hours. Or maybe not.<br>You are a waterslide technician inspecting safety. Or maybe not.<br>You are an investigator sent to look for missing people. Or maybe not.<br>You are alone. Or maybe not.<br><br>In Journey To The Center Of The Lost Waterpark you discover why you are there and who you are.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no enemies to fight, to avoid or to hide from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no jump scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to enjoy a journey which includes collecting items, solving puzzles, carefully navigating through areas and ... riding waterslides.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, your skills and your way of thinking will be put to the test in a waterpark scenery that is not what it seems to be - welcoming you with liminality and symmetry.<br><br>Dark corridors, beautifully bright rooms, claustrophobic hallways, hidden passages and intense waterslide riding await you on this illusive journey.<br><br>Are you able to reveal your purpose and the existence of the Lost Waterpark?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a life guard. Or maybe not.<br>You are the waterpark's janitor outside opening hours. Or maybe not.<br>You are a waterslide technician inspecting safety. Or maybe not.<br>You are an investigator sent to look for missing people. Or maybe not.<br>You are alone. Or maybe not.<br><br>In Journey To The Center Of The Lost Waterpark you discover why you are there and who you are.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no enemies to fight, to avoid or to hide from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no jump scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to enjoy a journey which includes collecting items, solving puzzles, carefully navigating through areas and ... riding waterslides.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, your skills and your way of thinking will be put to the test in a waterpark scenery that is not what it seems to be - welcoming you with liminality and symmetry.<br><br>Dark corridors, beautifully bright rooms, claustrophobic hallways, hidden passages and intense waterslide riding await you on this illusive journey.<br><br>Are you able to reveal your purpose and the existence of the Lost Waterpark?</p>",
    "short_description": "In this first-person experience you visit a waterpark unlike any others you have seen before. Your adventure leads you through eerie and beautiful surroundings with puzzles and obstacles while you uncover the secrets of the lost waterpark.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
